    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>A crescent moon shimmer above The Studio in the still silence. I see 12 spirits animating their day. Grove Skyhigh, a diligent musician, moves with purpose not far away. The world is lost in pale fog. The world is bitter and quiet under winter.</description>
